{
  "description": "The image shows a single quadrupedal creature in right-facing profile against a plain off-white background, standing on a flat pale surface with small patches of green grass and dirt under its feet and a soft gray shadow. The animal has the overall body shape, dense shaggy fur, head, and paws of a brown bear, but bears glossy dark reddish-brown to black exoskeletal features. Its fur is dark chocolate brown on the back, sides, and outer legs, with longer, paler tan to cream fur on the muzzle, lower cheek, chest, and belly. The body is robust and low-slung with a thick neck, deep chest, and four sturdy columnar legs. A single large, smooth, glossy black horn curves up and backward from the middle of the forehead, with two small tooth-like points on its inner curve. Multiple smooth, shiny, segmented plates of the same dark color are embedded in the fur on the back, sides, neck, hips, and outer legs, and a row of six small dark oval openings sits in the pale fur on the lower flank below the large side plate. The illustration is rendered in a detailed natural-history style with highlights indicating gloss on the horn and plates.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "bear-like, covered in dense brown fur with a lighter tan muzzle, a large black nose at the tip, small dark brown eyes with highlights on the side of the head, a closed mouth with a visible lip line and faint whiskers, and thick fur on the cheeks and throat",
      "where": "at the right end of the body, in profile facing right, with the neck connecting to the shoulders"
    },
    {
      "part": "horns",
      "looks_like": "single large, smooth, glossy dark brown to black horn, sharply pointed at the tip, curving upward and backward, with two small pointed projections on the concave inner edge and a broad base set in the fur of the forehead between the eyes and ears",
      "where": "arising from the mid-forehead on top of the head"
    },
    {
      "part": "ears",
      "looks_like": "two small, rounded, densely furry ears, same brown as the head fur, with soft rounded tips",
      "where": "on top of the head just behind the base of the horn"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "four thick, columnar, heavily furred legs, dark brown on the outer surfaces with longer shaggy fur, lighter on the inner chest and belly, held vertically under the body in a standing posture",
      "where": "two forelegs under the chest/shoulder and two hind legs under the hips, all four separately visible in side view"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "four broad paws at the ends of the legs, covered in dark brown fur with long, curved, pale off-white to light tan claws protruding forward from the toes, in contact with the ground",
      "where": "at the bottom of each leg on the ground surface"
    },
    {
      "part": "plates",
      "looks_like": "multiple irregular, smooth, highly glossy dark reddish-brown plates with pale segmented lines dividing them into sections and bright specular highlights; includes two small oval plates on the upper back, one very large rectangular-segmented plate on the mid-flank, one large curved plate on the rear hip, two overlapping curved plates on the side of the neck/shoulder, and smaller rounded plates on the outer upper foreleg and outer upper hind leg",
      "where": "embedded in the fur on the dorsal back, lateral sides, neck, hips, and outer surfaces of the legs"
    },
    {
      "part": "markings",
      "looks_like": "a horizontal row of six small, dark, vertically oval openings with thin pale rims, evenly spaced, set in the pale cream fur",
      "where": "on the lower side of the body just below the large mid-flank plate, above the belly"
    }
  ],
